# Roadmap

## Vision

The goal of the **Diabetes Metabolic Model** is to evolve into a comprehensive, open educational resource that explains diabetes through a systems-oriented approach.

---

# Version 1.x

## Documentation

* ✅ Initial project documentation
* ✅ Educational metabolic model
* ✅ ASCII system diagram
* ✅ Medical disclaimer
* ✅ Open-source licensing
* ✅ Community contribution guidelines

---

# Version 2.x

## Visualization

* Interactive SVG diagrams
* Mermaid diagrams
* High-resolution PNG illustrations
* Printable PDF version
* Color-coded physiological pathways

---

## Physiology

Expand the model with:

* Pancreas
* Skeletal muscle
* Adipose tissue
* Kidneys
* Digestive system
* Hormonal regulation
* Glucagon
* GLP-1
* Incretin response

---

